  "descriptionMarkdown": "### Introduction\n\nA comprehensive mall that can be built at a very early stage, producing a wide variety of logistics and production items on Navuis.\n\nI created this as a compact construction yard for my tiny train grid (64x64) but found it's also convenient for starting the game.\n\nBecause it uses a single belt for delivering mixed ingredients, it is very easy to change/extend the items to be made.\n\n### Starting Requirements\n- Yellow belts\n- Yellow inserters\n- Assembly Machine 1\n- Small electric pole\n- Some assembly machine 2 (for handling fluids) and one electric furnace can be built later\n\nUpgrading to better belts, assembly machines, and inserters will improve production rate.\n\n## What It Builds\n\n### Logistics\nEverything on Navuis, except:\n- Wooden chest\n- Iron chest\n- Burner inserter\n- Small electric pole\n- Artillery wagon\n- Spidertron\n- Ice platform\n- Foundation\n- Cliff explosives\n\n### Production\nEverything on Navuis, except:\n- Burner mining drill\n- Agricultural tower\n- Biolab\n- Lightning rod\n- Tier 1 Quality module\n- Tier 2/3 modules\n\n### Changelog\n[2025-10-10] V2: Downgraded to small electric poles, boosted production rate (5x for some items, V1 was too slow) by dividing the mall into four areas. No longer building iron chests and Tier 1 Quality modules due to limited space. Limits chest inventory to 5 stacks of items by default.\n\n[2025-10-11] V3: Further boost production rate by moving iron plate from global loop to area loops.",
